THE MANAGER  SREE RAMA GENERAL  INSURANCE CO.LTD.,
 MYSORE-570 001.
 ...RESPONDENTS (BY SRI. B.PRADEEP, ADVOCATE FOR R2;

Hence, the following:
ORDER 1. MFA Crob.No.57/2019 and MFA No.3566/2018 are allowed in part;
2. Respondent No.2-insurance company is held liable to pay the petitioner-Geetha a sum of Rs.11,45,300/- along with interest at the rate of 6% p.a. from the date of petition before Tribunal till realization within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of this order;
3. Amount in deposit shall stand transferred to the concerned Tribunal for disbursement;
4. MFA No.3083/2019 is hereby dismissed and the order of Tribunal is confirmed;
